{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感觉樱乃总是帮我挑礼物呢」", "text_idx": 132, "plain": "「感觉樱乃总是帮我挑礼物呢」", "plain_idx": 132, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只是我自作主张跟着哥哥罢了」", "text_idx": 134, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5355", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和哥哥一起买东西，很开心」", "text_idx": 136, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5356", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨晚回到家后，我和樱乃聊了聊天。", "text_idx": 138, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聊了关于圣诞节的话题。", "text_idx": 139, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也聊了我要送给纱凪的礼物。", "text_idx": 140, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我说还没决定好，\\n结果樱乃就决定要陪我去挑礼物。", "text_idx": 141, "plain": "我说还没决定好，结果樱乃就决定要陪我去挑礼物。", "plain_idx": 142, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「昨天和纱凪同学去约会了？」", "text_idx": 143, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5357", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，你发现了？」", "text_idx": 145, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为哥哥一大早就心神不宁的」", "text_idx": 146, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5358", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，亲亲了吗？」", "text_idx": 148, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5359", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「噗？！」", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……樱乃，你原来还对这个感兴趣啊？」", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这是理央亲的口头禅」", "text_idx": 152, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5360", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说起来，理央现在好像偶尔还会来家里找樱乃玩。", "text_idx": 154, "plain": "说起来，理央现在好像偶尔还会来家里找樱乃玩。", "plain_idx": 154, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还没亲呢」", "text_idx": 155, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「回答得这么认真，我都不知道该怎么回复了」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5361", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我该怎么回答？」", "text_idx": 158, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5362", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥要和妹妹练习亲亲，应该是这么个剧情走向」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5363", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真要那样可就麻烦了」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「又回答得这么认真」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5364", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥还是放松一下比较好」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5365", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好吧。我要不要和妹妹练习一下亲亲呢～」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……啵」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5366", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是不是，你怎么是这么个反应？」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥你个花心男」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5367", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管我回答得认真还是不认真，\\n樱乃好像都有些不太满意。", "text_idx": 174, "plain": "不管我回答得认真还是不认真，樱乃好像都有些不太满意。", "plain_idx": 175, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼，接下来就只等圣诞节到来了啊」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「买东西很开心」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5368", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和樱乃转了很多店，\\n最后给纱凪买了一个挽头发的白色发带。", "text_idx": 179, "plain": "我和樱乃转了很多店，最后给纱凪买了一个挽头发的白色发带。", "plain_idx": 180, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃提议说送随身物品比较好，\\n所以就选了这个。", "text_idx": 181, "plain": "樱乃提议说送随身物品比较好，所以就选了这个。", "plain_idx": 182, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪如果能喜欢就最好了。", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对了，也给你买些东西吧。\\n　虽然有点早，但就当是提前送你圣诞礼物了」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": "「对了，也给你买些东西吧。　虽然有点早，但就当是提前送你圣诞礼物了」", "plain_idx": 185, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我不要」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5369", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用客气呀」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我一直都在从哥哥那里收获礼物」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5370", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么礼物？」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「开心的时光」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5371", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只是这样一起走着，我就很开心了」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5372", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，我什么都不要」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5373", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃……」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "参加社团活动，然后与纱凪开始交往后。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我在家中和樱乃一起度过的时间也相应地减少了。", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但樱乃依然说她很开心。", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你不去找个男朋友吗？」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，不找」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5374", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今年圣诞节我会和爱理一起过」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5375", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们之前每年圣诞节都是和家人一起过的。", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以，今年不能和她一起过节实在遗憾。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看到哥哥幸福的样子，我也很幸福」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5376", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这就是最棒的礼物了」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5377", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那回去的时候我请你吃顿饭吧」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这个好」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5378", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我好幸福」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5379", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到她这样的笑容，我不得不振作起精神继续努力。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "作为哥哥，只要看到妹妹露出这副笑容，我就也会感到幸福。", "text_idx": 219, "plain": "作为哥哥，只要看到妹妹露出这副笑容，我就也会感到幸福。", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
